OL,3,GNEWSAReform bid to oust presiding      
OL,4,Aofficer fails after its Senedd boycott 
OL,5,Aends                                   
OL,7,FAn attempt by Reform UK to remove the  
OL,8,FSenedd's presiding officer has failed, 
OL,9,Ffollowing a passionate speech to the   
OL,10,FWelsh Parliament by Huw Irranca-Davies.
OL,12,FMembers of the Senedd (MSs) rejected   
OL,13,FReform's motion by 55 votes to 29.     
OL,15,FEarlier the party ended a two-week     
OL,16,Fboycott of most proceedings in the     
OL,17,Fchamber after one of them, Joe Martin, 
OL,18,Fwas banned from speaking and told to   
OL,19,Fapologise for remarks about            
OL,20,Fimmigration.                           
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
