OL,4,Aofficer fails after its Senedd boycott 
OL,5,Aends                                   
OL,7,FIrranca-Davies, whose title is Llywydd,
OL,8,Fsaid his duty was to "apply the rules  
OL,9,Ffairly and impartially".               
